    as .dta format

. restore

. merge m:1 folio using `visitdate', keep(master match) nogen

    Result                      Number of obs
    -----------------------------------------
    Not matched                             0
    Matched                            31,500  
    -----------------------------------------

. 
. * Children are weighed and measured in Book S, which has its own visit file, 
> and for about a quarter of 2005 households the last Book S visit is 3 or more
>  months after the last Book C visit. So we use the last dated Book S visit as
>  the measurement date, day = 15 like Book C
. preserve

.     use "$path/hh05dta_bs/s_conpor.dta", clear
(VERSION 14 Jan 2008)

.     keep folio secuencia anio mes

.     drop if missing(anio, mes)
(0 observations deleted)

.     sort folio secuencia

.     by folio: keep if _n == _N
(4,422 observations deleted)

.     gen meas_date = mdy(mes, 15, 2000 + anio)

.     keep folio meas_date

.     tempfile measdate

.     save `measdate'
