. * We add up each row, then convert every unit to months
. egen food_week = rowtotal(cs02?_?2 cs15? cs04?_*2)

. egen month_items = rowtotal(cs16?_2 cs18_2)

. egen quarter_items = rowtotal(cs22?_2 cs24?_2)

. egen year_items = rowtotal(cs27?_2 cs29_2)

. egen school_year = rowtotal(cs34a_12 cs34a_22 cs35a_12 cs35a_22)

. egen school_transport = rowtotal(cs36a_12 cs36a_22)

. * School transport is converted to years and then months, same with food week
> . Also the school_year is just divided by 12 for months not by 10.5 as we spr
> ead out the cost (also we already double checked why we are using this 12 ins
> tead of 10.5)
. gen hh_expend_month = food_week * 52 / 12 + month_items + quarter_items / 3 +
>  year_items / 12 + school_year / 12 + school_transport * 10.5 / 12

. * Rowtotal counts blanks as 0, which is right for items that were skipped, bu
> t 14 households did not finish the section - a filter question is blank, so t
> heir total stays missing not 0
. replace hh_expend_month = . if missing(cs03, cs17, cs23, cs28, cs32, cs08a, c
> s08b, cs08c, cs08d, cs08e, cs08f, cs08g, cs08h, cs08i, cs08j)
