.     * 00631003 are coded 23-025, but Quintana Roo has no municipality 025, on
> ly 001-011. In 2009 the same household as 00631003 is in 23-005
.     replace mpio = 5 if folio == "00631003" & ent == 23 & mpio == 25
(1 real change made)

.     * 00624005 is also coded 23-025, but it has no record in Quintana Roo in 
> any other wave, so we cannot observe its real municipality. We set it to miss
> ing
.     replace mpio = . if folio == "00624005" & ent == 23 & mpio == 25
(1 real change made, 1 to missing)

.     * 02492002 is coded 15-424, but Estado de Mexico only has municipalities 
> 001-125. Its origin household in 2002 and the same household in 2009 are in 1
> 5-106, Toluca
.     replace mpio = 106 if folio == "02492002" & ent == 15 & mpio == 424
(1 real change made)

.     * We set it to missing instead of guessing 25-014
.     replace mpio = . if folio == "07005000" & ent == 25 & mpio == 20
(1 real change made, 1 to missing)

